OL,3,GNEWSA'Naive' police staff who leaked
OL,4,Ainformation jailed
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo police call handlers who "flaunted"
OL,7,Ftheir training by looking up and
OL,8,Fpassing on confidential information to
OL,9,Fcriminals have been jailed.
OL,11,FJessica Fitzhugh and Ellie-Mae Doherty,
OL,12,Fboth 22, accessed personal details
OL,13,Fabout their criminal boyfriends while
OL,14,Fworking for Derbyshire Constabulary.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,363,360,200,160,0,100
