OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F362A1788499588
OL,1,W5j 5Q7+ js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(E)
OL,3,GNEWSA'Naive' police staff who leaked
OL,4,Ainformation jailed
OL,5,
OL,6,FFitzhugh, from Belper, admitted
OL,7,Funauthorised access to computer
OL,8,Fmaterial, and Doherty, from Ripley,
OL,9,Fpleaded guilty to the more serious
OL,10,Foffence of misconduct in a public
OL,11,Foffice, after she passed on to her
OL,12,Fpartner some of the information she
OL,13,Ffound.
OL,15,FDoherty was jailed for 11 months and
OL,16,FFitzhugh for four months after a
OL,17,Ftwo-day hearing at Leicester Crown
OL,18,FCourt, which concluded on Thursday.
